<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="3JN" style="id">- TarifitLS</book>
  <para style="h">3 Yuḥanna</para>
  <para style="toc3">3Yuḥ</para>
  <para style="toc2">3 Yuḥanna</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ṯabrat wis ṯȓaṯa n arrasul Yuḥanna</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ṯabrat wis ṯȓaṯa n arrasul Yuḥanna</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="3JN 1" />
  <para style="s">Lmuqaddima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="3JN 1:1" />
    <char style="it">Nec</char> ḏ amɣar, <char style="it">tariɣ ṯabrat-a</char> i Ɣayus wenni iy xafi iƹizzen ḏi lḥaqiqa. <verse eid="3JN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="3JN 1:2" />Ay uma inu iƹizzen, tẓaǧiɣ axak isseqsa ȓxir aɣarek ṯiȓi ṣṣaḥeṯ nnec wami ṯeǧiḏ mliḥ ḏi ȓaƹmar nnec. <verse eid="3JN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="3JN 1:3" />Minzi nec farḥeɣ aṭṭas wami d usin ȓebƹaḍ n wawmaṯen cehḏen xak x lḥaqiqa iy ḏayec ḏ mammec cek ƹaḏ ṯeggured nican ḏi lḥaqiqa. <verse eid="3JN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="3JN 1:4" />Farrḥeɣ aṭṭas s waṭṭas war zemmareɣ aḏ arniɣ xmi tesȓiɣ ṯarwa inu gguren nican x ubriḏ n lḥaqiqa.<verse eid="3JN 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="3JN 1:5" />Ay uma inu iƹizzen, cek ḏayec ttiqeṯ wami teggeḏ lmejhud nnec ƹlaḥsab awmaṯen-a waxxa niṯni tasen-d ɣarek ḏ ibarraniyen.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Awmaṯen-a aḏ iȓin can n wawmaṯen iy d itwassekken zi jmaƹeṯ n umɣar-a bac aḏ raḥen ɣar ṯjumaƹ n ȓmuminin aḏaysent ḥeddṯen aḏaysent cejjƹen ȓmuminin.</char></note> <verse eid="3JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="3JN 1:6" />Cehḏen xak ḏanita zzaṯ i jmaƹeṯ x ȓemḥibbeṯ nnec. Aḏ teggeḏ mliḥ <char style="it">ƹaweḏ</char> meȓa ṯdebbareḏ xasen x ubriḏ nsen ƹlaḥsab min iteḥḏaja Arebbi. <verse eid="3JN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="3JN 1:7" />Yina twassekken-d ƹlaḥsab isem nni <char style="it">yuƹȓan</char>, war jemmƹen bu <char style="it">lmuƹawana</char> zeg yinni war iḏeffaren ca Arebbi. <verse eid="3JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="3JN 1:8" />S manaya itxeṣṣa u labud a nƹawen awmaṯen-a am yina bac a nexḏem ak wayawya ƹlaḥsab lḥaqiqa.<verse eid="3JN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aceṯci x Diyutrif</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="3JN 1:9" />Uriɣ ijjen n wawaȓ i jmaƹeṯ walakin yugi Diyutrif i ssulṭa nneɣ ȓaḥeqqac netta iteƹjib-as aḏ yiȓi ḏ amezwaru. <verse eid="3JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="3JN 1:10" />S manaya meȓa usiɣ-d nec, aḏ feḍḥeɣ min itegg netta issawaȓ s wawaȓ n ṯubbuhȓiya war iḥȓin ḍed nneɣ. War iqniƹ ca s manayenni, netta itagi aḏ itreḥḥab s wawmaṯen isbedda uȓa ḏ yinni itreḥḥaben zzaysen itazzeȓ xasen zi jmaƹeṯ.<verse eid="3JN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="3JN 1:11" />Ay uma inu iƹizzen, war tqellad ca min iǧan ḏ aƹeffan; Lla, qelled min iǧan ḏ aṣebḥan. Wenni iteggen min iǧan ḏ aṣebḥan netta zi Arebbi; Wenni iteggen min iǧan ḏ aƹeffan netta war itwiȓi ca Arebbi. <verse eid="3JN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="3JN 1:12" />Amma Dimitriyus cehhḏen xas mliḥ qaƹ iwḏan waxxa uȓa ḏ lḥaqiqa ṯcehheḏ xas s yixef nnes. Axas narni waxxa ḏ chaḏeṯ nneɣ u kenniw ṯessnem belli chaḏeṯ nneɣ neccin ḏ ṣṣaḥ.<verse eid="3JN 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lxitam n ṯebrat-a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="3JN 1:13" />Itɣima-ayi ƹaḏ aṭṭas min ḏac d ɣa ariɣ walakin ḥsen war ḏac ṯiḏ tariɣ ca s stilu ḏ ssmex. <verse eid="3JN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="3JN 1:14" />Lla, tmenniɣ ac ẓreɣ ḏeɣya ȓexddenni a nessiweȓ aɣembub ḏeg uɣembub.<verse eid="3JN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="3JN 1:15" />Aɣarek yiȓi ȓehna. Tsawwaḍen-ac-d sȓam ṣṣḥaba. Seǧem xasen x ṣṣḥaba kuȓ ijjen s yisem nnes.<verse eid="3JN 1:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="3JN 1" />
</usx>